# OPUS-TYPED-BINDING-20260930-20, K03 NS-ROLES-CALL (docs :668): Model exists, so `Model: b c` at the root is Model's call,
# refused by its arity.  EXACT DEBT (steps/defects.md#typed-binding-purpose-debt): b typed Model and bound to c's
# descriptor, no merge, no copy -- a write through b read through c (was Entry 7).
Model:
    size_t: value 1U
end: Model

Other:
    int: p 1
    int: q 2
end: Other

int: out 0
c: merge: Model
c\value: 5U
Model: b c
b\value: 9U
if: c\value = 9U
    out: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: out; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
